Z||000014||Patrick||09-04-99||05:42 PM||||<br>After reading Ogre's comments and then revisiting the <b>BlinkBlink</b> site, I have to agree that there shouldn't be much altering of the original wiring, except for right at the lamps. The site readdressed by 454 (thanks!) also confirms this. At this site there is a schematic of a relatively simple design which should accomplish what I want. However, I'm not an electronics expert by any means and I'm not even sure what a "<b>4528</b>" is.<p> <IMG SRC="http://www.euronet.nl/users/fo_elmo/images/seqturnnb.gif"> <p>Is there someone who can look at this schematic and maybe describe it in plain English?<IMG SRC="/ubb/smile.gif" WIDTH=15 HEIGHT=15><p>
