Z||000069||Patrick||11-20-1999||03:55 AM||||<BR>Yeah, here's a link to the 2nd thread:<P> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/001185.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/001185.html</A> <P>As the guy who started all this with the original post, I obviously have an interest in this project. However, Greg is the one who did all the work designing and building a prototype. And Cliff did the layout for the design of the board. <P>It would be great if some enterprising soul could make up a few of the boards that are required (with and/or without the components) and sell them to those of us at this forum who are interested (for a fair price). Anyone interested in making up these boards?<P>And who would be interested in buying either: <BR>(A) the board complete with components, or <BR>(B) just the plain, unfinished board?<P>I, for one, would like just the plain board so that I could acquire and mount the components myself.||||reg||14
